# Part D: Configuring Burp Suite

## Step 13: Open Burp Suite

1. Launch Burp Suite.

2. Select:

   ```text id="m8q5vf"
   Temporary Project
   ```

3. Click:

   ```text id="z3p9tw"
   Start Burp
   ```

---

## Step 14: Configure Proxy Listener

1. Navigate to:

```text id="y5r2qx"
Proxy → Options
```

2. Under:

   ```text id="x8m4vn"
   Proxy Listeners
   ```

3. Click:

   ```text id="k6t1pd"
   Edit
   ```

4. Select:

   ```text id="p4w7mb"
   All Interfaces
   ```

5. Click:

   ```text id="r9v2qe"
   OK
   ```

Observation:

* Burp Suite accepts traffic from emulator.

---

## Step 15: Enable Intercept

Navigate to:

```text id="u2x5pk"
Proxy → Intercept
```

Turn:

```text id="m1v9rd"
Intercept ON
```

---

# Part E: Capturing HTTP Traffic

## Step 16: Open Browser in Emulator

1. Open Chrome browser inside emulator.
2. Visit:

```text id="c8n4tw"
http://example.com
```

Observation:

* Request appears inside Burp Suite HTTP history.

---

## Step 17: Verify HTTP Traffic

In Burp Suite:

```text id="w7q3mx"
Proxy → HTTP History
```

Observation:

* HTTP requests and responses are visible.

